build/
src/gen/*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ...except the note streams. src/gen is ignored because everything in it is
# cheap to regenerate from checked-in sources -- art/*.json, gentables.py. The
# music is not: its source is 7 MB of ogg in musicsamples/, which is not worth
# putting in history for ever. So the 70 KB of generated streams IS checked in,
# and the repo builds without the audio. Run `make music` when the ogg files
# are present and a tune has changed.
!src/gen/mus_*.asm

# The source audio: 7 MB, and the generated streams above are what the
# build actually needs. Add them deliberately if you want them versioned.
musicsamples/

# Debugging screenshots. They were useful once and are not source; a git add -A
# swept them in the first time.
Errors/
